<!-- 带区域行（show-area，查询 / 报表页）：「区域」和「门店」两行都由组件渲染，样式类由宿主页面传入 -->
<block wx:if="{{showArea}}">
  <view class="row-class">
    <text class="label-class">{{areaLabel}}</text>
    <view class="value-class">
      <checkbox-group class="area-group" bindchange="areaChanged">
        <label class="area-item"><checkbox value="万龙" checked="{{areaWanlong}}" />万龙</label>
        <label class="area-item"><checkbox value="旗舰" checked="{{areaFlagship}}" />旗舰</label>
      </checkbox-group>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="row-class">
    <text class="label-class">{{shopLabel}}</text>
    <view class="value-class">
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{name_list}}" value="{{currentSelectedIndex}}" bindchange="selectChanged" class="input" style="width: 200rpx;">
        <picker-view>{{name_list[currentSelectedIndex]}}</picker-view>
      </picker>
    </view>
  </view>
</block>
<picker wx:else mode="selector" range="{{name_list}}" bindchange="selectChanged" class="input" style="width: 200rpx;" >
  <picker-view >{{name_list[currentSelectedIndex]}}</picker-view>
</picker>
